# Environment Variables

## Required Variables

| Variable | Description | Example Value |
|----------|-------------|---------------|
| LIVEKIT_API_KEY | LiveKit API key for authentication | `your_livekit_api_key` |
| LIVEKIT_API_SECRET | LiveKit API secret for authentication | `your_livekit_api_secret` |
| VITE_LIVEKIT_URL | LiveKit server URL (used in frontend) | `wss://your-livekit-server.com` |
| FLASK_ENV | Flask environment (development/production) | `development` |

## Example .env file

```
LIVEKIT_API_KEY=your_livekit_api_key
LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=your_livekit_api_secret
VITE_LIVEKIT_URL=wss://your-livekit-server.com
FLASK_ENV=development